<!-- ================= Terms ================= -->
<section class="section policy-body">
    <div class="container">
        <article class="policy-card">
            <p class="policy-updated">Last updated: October 2026</p>

            <h2>1. Services</h2>
            <p>NEXUS provides broadband, dial-up and telephone services to homes and businesses in Karachi, Lahore and Islamabad. Service availability at a specific address depends on the outcome of a feasibility check.</p>

            <h2>2. Orders and installation</h2>
            <p>Orders can be placed online or through a retail branch, and each order is issued a reference number you can use to track its progress. Installation charges and security deposits apply as shown for the selected plan.</p>

            <h2>3. Plans and billing</h2>
            <p>Plans are billed per billing cycle for the validity period shown against the plan. A bill is made up of the plan charge plus any equipment or replacement charges, less applicable discounts, plus the applicable service tax (12.24%), together with any previous outstanding balance.</p>

            <h2>4. Payments</h2>
            <p>Please settle each bill by the due date shown on it. If you have a question about a charge or need help with a payment, contact our billing team before the due date.</p>

            <h2>5. Your responsibilities</h2>
            <p>You agree to keep your contact and installation details accurate, to use the connection lawfully, and not to resell or share the service outside the premises it is installed at without our written agreement.</p>

            <h2>6. Equipment</h2>
            <p>Equipment supplied with your connection, such as a router or modem, remains the property of NEXUS unless stated otherwise. Lost or damaged equipment may be replaced at the applicable replacement charge.</p>

            <h2>7. Changes to these terms</h2>
            <p>We may update these terms or our plan pricing from time to time. Updated terms are published on this page, and material changes are communicated through our official channels.</p>

            <h2>8. Contact</h2>
            <p>Questions about these terms? Email <a href="mailto:support@nexos.local">support&#64;nexos.local</a> or call <a href="tel:+922111122333">+92 21 111 122 333</a>.</p>

            <p class="policy-note">
                These terms reflect how the current NEXUS service management system operates and
                should be reviewed by a legal advisor before publication.
            </p>
        </article>
    </div>
</section>
